  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1818,
      "text": "We have placed constellations in the heaven and adorned it for the onlookers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1819,
      "text": "and We have guarded it from every accursed devil,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1820,
      "text": "except the one who manages to eavesdrop, he will then be pursued by a visible burning flame.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1821,
      "text": "As for the earth, We have spread it out and placed therein firm mountains, and caused to grow therein everything in due proportion.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1822,
      "text": "And We have made therein for you means of sustenance and for those[8] whom you do not provide.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1823,
      "text": "There is nothing except that We have its treasuries, and We do not send it down except in a determined measure.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1824,
      "text": "And We send fertilizing winds[9], and send down rain from the sky for you to drink, and it is not you who could store it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1825,
      "text": "Indeed, it is We Who give life and cause death, and We are the Inheritors [of all things].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1826,
      "text": "We surely know those of you who have gone before and those who are yet to come.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1827,
      "text": "It is your Lord Who will gather them together. He is All-Wise, All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 219,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1828,
      "text": "We have created man from sounding clay, made of aging mud[10].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1829,
      "text": "And the jinn[11] We created before that, from smokeless fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1830,
      "text": "And [remember] when your Lord said to the angels, “I am going to create a human being from sounding clay, made of aging mud.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1831,
      "text": "When I have shaped him and breathed into him of My spirit[12], then fall down before him in prostration.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1832,
      "text": "Thereupon, all of the angels fell down in prostration,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 263,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1833,
      "text": "except for Iblīs, who refused to be with those who prostrated[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
